UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '<The paw of the mighty bear Ursangous is your trophy for this part of the Ashenvale Hunt.  On the paw is a small quarter-crescent emblem; the significance of the emblem remains a mystery.$B$BThe paw should be brought to Senani Thunderheart in Splintertree Post to prove that you have bested the mighty creature and completed this portion of the hunt.>' WHERE `ID` = 23 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'The paw of the mighty bear Ursangous is your trophy for this part of the Ashenvale Hunt.  On the paw is a small quarter-crescent emblem; the significance of the emblem remains a mystery.$B$BThe paw should be brought to Senani Thunderheart in Splintertree Post to prove that you have bested the mighty creature and completed this portion of the hunt.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '$n.  The Dragonmaw orc clan is showing its strength in more than just Algaz.\r\n\r\nCaptain Stoutfist has asked to speak with those willing to offer aid against these orcs.  He is inside the keep, in the war room.' WHERE `ID` = 473 AND `QuestDescription` <=> '$N.  The Dragonmaw orc clan is showing its strength in more than just Algaz.  Captain Stoutfist has asked to speak with those willing to offer aid against these orcs.  He is inside the keep, in the war room.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'This camp used to be a dozen warriors strong, $n. Now, they are all dead.\r\n\r\nThat mage, Rimtori, has slain them all. She played Belgrom like a lute; claiming Azshara would hold great riches... powerful items.\r\n\r\nBelgrom sent us to protect her, and said we would be rewarded. Well, look who\'s the fool--we were slaughtered.\r\n\r\nThe blood elves are camped along the southern bluffs on the northern peninsula. Kill every one you see. Then, find the source of Rimtori\'s power so we can exact our revenge.' WHERE `ID` = 3505 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'I thought as much.$B$BWe start our crusade against her workers along the southern bluffs on the northern peninsula of Azshara. Kill them with bloody rage--let them know they\'ve betrayed the wrong allies.$B$BDo not concern yourself with her yet--she spends most of her time with her bodyguards searching Azshara. It would be prudent after you\'ve slain her workers to find her personal camp. Scouting out where we can attack her would be wise. Perhaps there is something there we can use to provoke her.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'I admit, $n, I\'ve made the most of my situation in Azshara. Belgrom\'s punishment has had its share of benefits.$B$BBefore I left, I did some research and you would be surprised how many valuable items are lying around.$B$BThere are tablets throughout the Ruins of Eldarath to the east that I need. All four are named after highborne wizards. Get them for me and we\'ll talk some more.' WHERE `ID` = 3517 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'I admit, $N, I\'ve made the most of my situation in Azshara. Belgrom\'s punishment has had its share of benefits.$B$BBefore I left, I did some research and you would be surprised how many valuable items are lying around.$B$BI\'ll tell you more about my deals, and even give you a cut of the profits, if you help me gather some of them.$B$BThere are tablets throughout the Ruins of Eldarath to the east that I need. All four are named after Highborne wizards. Get them for me and we\'ll talk some more.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Take this refined and purified Incendia Powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead.$B$BThe enchantment that I have weaved into the Incendia powder will summon Arikara to you, $n.$B$BI fear she may be stalking Cairne Bloodhoof; too much Tauren lore has changed, and I fear this has angered Arikara. Move quickly before all is lost, $c!' WHERE `ID` = 5088 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead.$B$BThe enchantment that I have weaved into the Incendia powder will summon Arikara to you, $N.$B$BI fear she may be stalking Cairne Bloodhoof; too much Tauren lore has changed, and I fear this has angered Arikara. Move quickly before all is lost, $c!' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Just a short time ago, one of your priests was here looking for you, $r. He said that if I were to see you, I should direct you towards the Hall of Mysteries. He said it was very important, but I would not be overly concerned if I were you. His demeanor seemed positive... as though it were good news. I wouldn\'t take too long in making my way there if I were you.$B$BElune be with you, good $r.' WHERE `ID` = 5638 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Just a short time ago, one of your priests was here looking for you, $r. He said that if I were to see you, I should direct you towards the Cathedral of Light. He said it was very important, but I would not be overly concerned if I were you. His demeanor seemed positive... as though it were good news. I wouldn\'t take too long in making my way there if I were you.$B$BElune be with you, good $r.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = '$n!  Your aid is needed in Feralas!$B$BAn outlaw mage, Lethtendris, has fled to the ancient elven ruins Eldre\'Thalas, now called Dire Maul.  It is believed she has an item of dangerous magical energy which must be recovered.$B$BLatronicus Moonspear requests agents to enter Dire Maul and retrieve the item from Lethtendris.$B$BServe the Alliance!  Seek out Latronicus at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.' WHERE `ID` = 7494 AND `QuestDescription` <=> '$N!  Your aid is needed in Feralas!$B$BAn outlaw mage, Lethtendris, has fled to the ancient elven ruins Eldre\'thalas, now called Dire Maul.  It is believed she has an item of dangerous magical energy which must be recovered.$B$BLatronicus Moonspear requests agents to enter Dire Maul and retrieve the item from Lethtendris.$B$BServe the Alliance!  Seek out Latronicus at the Feathermoon Stronghold in Feralas.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'A grisly scene, these two elves appear to have died locked in combat to the end. What could have brought such viciousness to their normally reserved demeanor?\r\n\r\nTheir bags and equipment are strewn along the shore. Was it a deal gone bad? A rival\'s ambush?\r\n\r\nSearch the source of the river for clues to the demise that was washed downstream.' WHERE `ID` = 7790 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Defeat the Warsong Mill, then return to me.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $n, and I shall reward you.' WHERE `ID` = 7872 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a Mark of Honor.  Bring it to me, $N, and I shall reward you.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a talisman of merit.  Bring me such a talisman, $n, and I shall reward you.' WHERE `ID` = 7873 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Beyond this tunnel you will find a field of strife and turmoil, young $c. The Horde continue to decimate our sacred forest, cutting down the evergreen foliage to power their machines of war.$B$BEnter Warsong Gulch and defend Silverwing Hold. Push back the invading Horde forces!$B$BDo this, and earn a Mark of Honor.  Bring it to me, $N, and I shall reward you.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you.  They\'ll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$B$BThat is why Arathi Basin is important.  There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources.  Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$B$BThat is what I want from you, $n.  Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a crate of resources.' WHERE `ID` = 8080 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'War must be fought with soldiers, any soldier will tell you.  They\'ll also say that a battle fought with poor gear or on an empty stomach is lost before it starts!$B$BThat is why Arathi Basin is important.  There are key areas in the basin that hold essential resources.  Metals, weapons, food, lumber - all are needed, and all can be gained there.$B$BThat is what I want from you, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, win the battle by holding more bases than the enemy, and return to me with a Mark of Honor.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi.  They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe.  We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.$B$BYou can help us, $n.  Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman.  Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain.' WHERE `ID` = 8123 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi.  They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe.  We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.$B$BYou can help us, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman.  Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the Mark of Honor you gain.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'The volume of water flowing across the rocks below the falls makes it easy to lose your footing. Its source must be the violently coursing rapids pouring into the Plaguelands.\r\n\r\nDistinctly elvish regalia and equipment seem to be scattered amidst the watery death.\r\n\r\nYou take the silver-trimmed scrap of dark cloth and the broken elven weapon hilt in your pack. Somebody at Light\'s Hope Chapel might know more about elf activity in these lands.' WHERE `ID` = 8152 AND `QuestDescription` <=> '$n, when you feel you are ready, there is a wisened furbolg hunter by the name of Ogtinc who resides in Azshara.  He may be able to enhance your teaching, and provide you with guidance.$b$bOgtinc is atop the cliffs northeast the Ruins of Eldarath in Azshara.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi.  They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe.  We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.$B$BYou can help us, $n.  Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman.  Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the resources you gain.' WHERE `ID` = 8160 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'The League of Arathor is sparing no expense in their move to retake Arathi.  They, and all the races of the Alliance, now stream to this distant region, intent on expanding their hold from Refuge Pointe.  We must stop them, and the best means to stop them is to take their supplies.$B$BYou can help us, $N.  Enter Arathi Basin, known for its rich mines, fertile land and skilled craftsman.  Capture and control every base you can, win the battle, and return to me with the Mark of Honor you gain.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'In order to summon Lord Valthalak we\'re first going to need to gather the other two-thirds of the amulet. To do that we need to get a brazier and some special coals to burn in it.$B$BThere are three nobles of fire, Lord Incedius in Blackrock Depths, Pyroguard Emberseer in Blackrock Spire and Executor Asharell in the Steppes, with what we need. Collect from each a piece of their remains, and then return to me with a Hallowed Brazier, which can be purchased from the Argent Dawn if you are honored by them.' WHERE `ID` = 8961 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'In order to summon Lord Valthalak we\'re first going to need to gather the other two-thirds of the amulet. To do that we need to get a brazier and some special coals to burn in it.$B$BThere are three nobles of fire, Lord Incedius in Blackrock Depths, Pyroguard Emberseer in Blackrock Spire and The Duke of Cynders in Silithus, with what we need. Collect from each a piece of their remains, and then return to me with a Hallowed Brazier, which can be purchased from the Argent Dawn if you are honored by them.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Almost there, and... By the Nether! Something is still disrupting my instruments.\r\n\r\nThis is most frustrating, $n. I have heard rumors that the local bandits have been practicing spells near Stone Cairn Lake. Maybe if you stop them, these disruptions will finally cease and I can get some work done?' WHERE `ID` = 91724 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Almost there, and... By the Nether! Something is still disrupting my instruments.$BThis is most frustrating, $n. I have heard rumors that the local bandits have been practicing spells near Stone Cairn Lake. Maybe if you stop them, these disruptions will finally cease and I can get some work done?' /* refresh */;
