UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'The recent emergence of the leylines on the surface of Zephras has been profound for our order. We have more direct and tangible access to the energies that permeate this place and it has increased our understanding of said magic greatly.\r\n\r\nThe Windshapers, however, view these emergences as scars on the land that must be \"healed\". This is an affront to our order and is something we simply cannot abide.\r\n\r\nGo to the leyline in the forest to the southwest and drive off the Windshapers you find there.' WHERE `ID` = 94413 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'The recent emergence of the leylines on the surface of Zephras has been profound for our order. We have more direct and tangible access to the energies that permeate this place and it has increased our understanding of said magic greatly.' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'Danitha and I fought against the Scourge in the defense of the Undercity when Naxxramas attacked. We lost many good friends that day, including the hero after which this keep was named--Garek Bandarion.\r\n\r\nHe might just have been the first Forsaken to rediscover how to wield the Light as a paladin. I am encouraged to see his legacy and potential live on here with Danitha and her cohort.\r\n\r\nIf only the rest of the Forsaken felt the same way...' WHERE `ID` = 96896 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'Danitha and I fought against the scourge in the defense of the Undercity when Naxxramas attacked. We lost many good friends that day, including the hero after which this keep was named--Garek Bandarion.$B$BHe might just have been the first Forsaken to rediscover how to wield the light as a paladin. I am encouraged to see his legacy and potential live on here with Danitha and her cohort.$B$BIf only the rest of the forsaken felt the same way...' /* refresh */;
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription` = 'You may not have our best interests at heart, but I won\'t deny an extra pair of hands. And if Dalaran falls, it takes everything with it--including your Undercity.\r\n\r\nSo, your benefactor wants in? Fine. I\'ll imbue your key to work past my wards so you can enter the city. Once you\'re in, meet me at the Violet Citadel where this all began. With everything going on the Kirin Tor will be too busy to stop you.\r\n\r\nScavenge what you will, but whatever happens, our first priority is to prevent a catastrophe.' WHERE `ID` = 96984 AND `QuestDescription` <=> 'You may not have our best interests at heart, but I won\'t deny an extra pair of hands. And if Dalaran falls, it takes everything with it--including your Undercity.$B$BSo, your benefactor wants in? Fine. I\'ll imbue your key to work past my wards so you can enter the city. Once you\'re in, meet me at the Violet Citadel where this all began.$B$BWith everything going on the Kirin Tor will be too busy to stop you. Scavenge what you will, but whatever happens, our first priority is to prevent a catastrophe.' /* refresh */;
